<title>USA: Conseco unit makes preferred offering.</title>
<headline>Conseco unit makes preferred offering.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Friday its Conseco Financing Trust I subsidiary offered 11 million of 9.16 percent Trust Originated Preferred Securities (TOPrS) at $25 per security.</p>
<p>Each TOPrS security will pay cumulative cash distributions at an annual rate of 9.16 percent of the stated $25 liquidation amount per security, payable quarterly starting December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
